{"steam_appid":3211680,"steam_name":"Tobacco Shop Simulator","trailer_hls":"https://video.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_trailers/3211680/838531960/da61f69d32827d44a2e650672a3e80d3402ae075/1750824802/hls_264_master.m3u8?t=1749028178","trailer_thumb":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/257149637/db7e92efe07b5a439562e3071db278049fb72c53/movie_600x337.jpg?t=1749028178","screenshots":["https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211680/ab641405809be336d4ebcb547aa11e6d6b64df20/ss_ab641405809be336d4ebcb547aa11e6d6b64df20.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784897618","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211680/ss_cd936aa3ffa43bac899829ddb03d8b901448b0cb.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784897618","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211680/47364e4d5bd0d8d448492c12e6184c085f31760c/ss_47364e4d5bd0d8d448492c12e6184c085f31760c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784897618","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211680/ss_e9b1bb6b6157a94496051cc9152957d040297085.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784897618","https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211680/ss_7c3b15937ae62145393b466051193bcf7604c22c.1920x1080.jpg?t=1784897618"],"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This is a first-person simulation game where you step into the role of a tobacco shop owner.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Work alone or with friends to expand your humble shop into a huge tobacco shop.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211680/extras/77751ef58ec2f0c8895cd03529b49130.poster.avif?t=1784897618\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211680/extras/77751ef58ec2f0c8895cd03529b49130.webm?t=1784897618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211680/extras/77751ef58ec2f0c8895cd03529b49130.mp4?t=1784897618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Co-Op Mode and Single Player</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Share the duties with your friends in co-op mode (for up to 4 players).</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The more players in the store, the more demanding customers will visit your store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Also, you can go solo and manage everything in the store. You can invite your friends anytime if you change your mind.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211680/extras/d44bdfb13ed100a98376407dad16a248.poster.avif?t=1784897618\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211680/extras/d44bdfb13ed100a98376407dad16a248.webm?t=1784897618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211680/extras/d44bdfb13ed100a98376407dad16a248.mp4?t=1784897618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Store Workflow</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Sign contracts with leading brands, order new products with an in-game computer or with your tablet while walking in the store, unpack the boxes, place the products into your store, and set the prices for your products.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Consider the market prices while setting up your product prices in the store for customer satisfaction.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always keep your store clean so as not to lose any customers. Also, be careful with the thieves to avoid some box losses that would cause a leak in your finances.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211680/extras/ed144550ffcb2929e41d716840ad6cdd.poster.avif?t=1784897618\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211680/extras/ed144550ffcb2929e41d716840ad6cdd.webm?t=1784897618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211680/extras/ed144550ffcb2929e41d716840ad6cdd.mp4?t=1784897618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Products</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Please make sure your customers find all their needs in the store.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Always expand your product portfolio and satisfy your customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Cigarettes, lighters, pipes, cigars, ashtrays, hookahs, e-cigarettes, tobacco, and smoking accessories... </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Be aware of the market prices and purchase more products when they're cheap.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211680/extras/a24ba52ce59a66ae0030434c4e4e7df5.poster.avif?t=1784897618\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211680/extras/a24ba52ce59a66ae0030434c4e4e7df5.webm?t=1784897618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211680/extras/a24ba52ce59a66ae0030434c4e4e7df5.mp4?t=1784897618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Customers</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Place a sufficient number of checkouts to reduce the waiting time for customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Scan products and collect payments whether in cash or with card purchases.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Don't forget to fulfill the online orders.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211680/extras/1cbbbb14f261055edbcf835336dfe39e.poster.avif?t=1784897618\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211680/extras/1cbbbb14f261055edbcf835336dfe39e.webm?t=1784897618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211680/extras/1cbbbb14f261055edbcf835336dfe39e.mp4?t=1784897618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Expansions and New Teammates</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Expand your store and warehouse by leveling up your store and budget.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire stockers to fill the racks.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Purchase more cash registers and hire new cashiers to minimize long queues at the checkouts and to reduce waiting time for customers.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Hire a janitor to clean the store and hire a security guard to chase down the thieves.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211680/extras/565d92663364aad188d282ce8ca57c44.poster.avif?t=1784897618\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211680/extras/565d92663364aad188d282ce8ca57c44.webm?t=1784897618\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3211680/extras/565d92663364aad188d282ce8ca57c44.mp4?t=1784897618\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p>","requirements_minimum":"<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit | Windows 8 64-bit | Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-9400F | AMD Ryzen 5 3600<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 8 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1050 | AMD Radeon RX-580<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1200 MB available space</li></ul>","requirements_recommended":"<strong>Recommended:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br></li><li><strong>OS *:</strong> Windows 7 64-bit | Windows 8 64-bit | Windows 10 64-bit<br></li><li><strong>Processor:</strong> Intel Core i5-11400F | AMD Ryzen 5 5600x<br></li><li><strong>Memory:</strong> 16 GB RAM<br></li><li><strong>Graphics:</strong> NVIDIA GeForce GTX 1060 | AMD Radeon R9-290X<br></li><li><strong>Network:</strong> Broadband Internet connection<br></li><li><strong>Storage:</strong> 1200 MB available space</li></ul>","genres":["Action","Adventure","Casual","Indie","RPG","Simulation","Sports"],"developers":["Business Tycoon"],"publishers":["Business Tycoon"],"release_date":"22 Jun, 2025"}